  "slug": "agent-synapse",
  "name": "Agent Synapse",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Let multiple Claude Code sessions talk to each other across projects. Each session gets a name, sends messages, checks its inbox, and sees who's online.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `synapse`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agent-synapse@claude-community` from `DisposableByDefault/agent-synapse`.\n\nCross-project messaging between Claude Code sessions via named agents.\n\nLet multiple Claude Code sessions talk to each other across projects. Each session gets a name, sends messages, checks its inbox, and sees who's online.",
